ings":{"full_width":false,"block_size":"large","subheading":"","title":"What the perfect fit looks like","content":"<p>Worn by gym girls with small waists & strong curvy hips—just like you.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":"","heading_color":"","heading_gradient":""}},"rich_text_PtqK3D":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"image_R6ietw":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/made_to_fit_your_body.jpg","width_mode":"custom","max_width":520,"mobile_max_width":360}},"divider_mbyDbN":{"type":"divider","settings":{}},"heading_XrBPJm":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"Why You’ll Love Them","heading_tag":"h3","text_color":"","gradient":""}},"richtext_xjLQDN":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>You’ve tried every kind of jeans. Too tight on your thighs. Too loose at the waist.<br\/><br\/>And somehow… still not flattering? Yeah, we’ve been there too.<\/p><p>That’s why we made CURVJEANS — jeans that actually <em>get<\/em> your body.<br\/><br\/>They hug your waist, give you room where you need it, and make you feel good when you look in the mirror.<\/p><p>No waist gap. No belt. No more compromises. Just jeans that fit <em>you<\/em> — finally.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["image_R6ietw","divider_mbyDbN","heading_XrBPJm","richtext_xjLQDN"],"settings":{"full_width":false,"content_width":"small","text_position":"start","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":""}},"multi_column_MKTerC":{"type":"multi-column","blocks":{"item_gJK6qB":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Jeans_made_for_your_body.jpg","video":"shopify:\/\/files\/videos\/84145fc1395647ad9b9fb9f10962fe21NikaTilborghs-ezgif.com-resize-video.mp4","column_size":"3","title":"Moves with you—all day","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>Super-stretchy denim that keeps up with your life (and never loses shape).<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}},"item_n87thD":{"type":"item","settings":{"video":"shopify:\/\/files\/videos\/Untitleddesign15-ezgif.com-resize-video.mp4","column_size":"3","title":"Zero Waist Gap. Seriously.","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>A waistband that actually fits your smaller waist and curvy hips.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}},"item_U6rfgB":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Denise_effortless_confidence.jpg","column_size":"3","title":"Confidence that lasts all day","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>No sliding, no pulling—just jeans that stay flattering from early mornings to late nights.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}}},"block_order":["item_gJK6qB","item_n87thD","item_U6rfgB"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"full_width":true,"stack_on_mobile":false,"gap":"large","text_alignment":"start","subheading":"","title":"How are CURVJEANS different?","content":"<p>Because jeans should fit <em>you<\/em>, not the other way around.<\/p>","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":""}},"faq_EfT76h":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"item_YhyjJt":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"How do I know if CURVJEANS will fit me?","content":"<p>We get it—finding jeans that <em>actually <\/em>fit is a struggle. That’s why CURVJEANS are designed specifically for smaller waists and wider hips.<br\/><br\/>Check our <a href=\"https:\/\/curvjeans.com\/pages\/size-guide\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Size Guide\">size guide <\/a>with real measurements and do our fit quiz or simply DM us! Still unsure? Our returns are super easy.<\/p>"}},"item_THfNfg":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"What if I order the wrong size?","content":"<p>No worries! You have 14 days to exchange or return—completely hassle-free. Just try them on at home and if it’s not love at first fit, you'll easy start your return via our <a href=\"https:\/\/curvjeans.returnless.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/curvjeans.returnless.com\/\">return page<\/a>.<\/p>"}},"item_7egfLh":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"What if they're not the one?","content":"<p>No stress! Not head over heels? Send them back within 14 days - it's that easy! Our returns means zero drama 💕<\/p>"}},"item_kJGmng":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"What makes CURVJEANS different from regular jeans?","content":"<p>We’re made different. CURVJEANS are designed for women with curves—especially if you’ve got stronger legs, glutes, and a small waist. No awkward fits, no compromises—just jeans that move with you instead of against you.<\/p>"}},"item_M7ecB8":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"Are CURVJEANS stretchy?","content":"<p>YES! Our stretch is like magic! They hold their shape (no baggy knees!) but move with you all day. Dance, sit, run - these babies won't let you down.<br\/><br\/>Plus, they're actually comfy enough to wear all day!<\/p>"}},"item_btxATh":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"Will they stay up without a belt?","content":"<p>Yes! CURVJEANS are made with a special waistband that fits snug at the waist—no more sliding down or constant adjusting. You can finally ditch the belt.<\/p>"}},"item_Ckt4Wt":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"When will I receive my order?","content":"<p>Can't wait to get your perfect jeans? We get it! Your CURVJEANS will arrive in 5-6 working days. We'll keep you updated every step of the way! 📦✨<\/p>"}},"item_XkAAKm":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"Can I pay later?","content":"<p>Yep! Just select Klarna at checkout and you can try now, pay later—no extra fees. Super easy, super safe.<\/p>"}},"item_yrACzw":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"Do you ship internationally?","content":"<p>Yes we do!<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["item_YhyjJt","item_THfNfg","item_7egfLh","item_kJGmng","item_M7ecB8","item_btxATh","item_Ckt4Wt","item_XkAAKm","item_yrACzw"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"full_width":true,"subheading":"","title":"FAQ","content":"<p>Your perfect-fit questions answered!<\/p>","team_avatar_width":160,"support_hours":"Our customer support is available Monday to Friday: 8a